WEBVTT

00:18:57.130 --> 00:19:00.897
And what that means
for actual legislation is unknown,

00:19:00.930 --> 00:19:02.430
but what is clear

00:19:02.463 --> 00:19:05.697
is that there are a lot more people
who want to have a say.

00:19:06.963 --> 00:19:09.030
All over the world,

00:19:09.063 --> 00:19:11.197
there are many cultures and families

00:19:11.230 --> 00:19:13.663
who practice their own rituals of death.

00:19:14.163 --> 00:19:18.397
These rituals are expressions

00:19:18.430 --> 00:19:21.963
based on their unique
situations and environments.

00:19:26.063 --> 00:19:28.163
If you could design your own death,

00:19:28.197 --> 00:19:30.430
what would the experience be like,